statistics.description:
Long-term statistics of the old AppDaemon/MQTT bridge were found under other entity IDs. They are copied into the entities of this integration (only hours before their own data) and the sums are continued, so the energy dashboard shows one continuous series.

**Water**

| Old statistic | New statistic | Period | Hours copied |
|---|---|---|---|
{table}

**Costs (energy dashboard)**: transferred to the cost statistics of the new entities

| Old cost statistic | New cost statistic | Period | Hours copied | Amount |
|---|---|---|---|---|
{costs}

Energy dashboard is switched to the new entities:
{energy}

Left over entities of the bridge that are removed (history stays in the database): {remove}

Old cost sensors {cost_entities} and all old statistics are only removed if you tick the option below. Create a backup first.

